  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Pod loss: ~10 s latency spike\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 4  \u00b7  **Symptom:** Latency spike of ~10 s after a deploy or pod loss.  \u00b7  **Cause:** Worker died mid-task; the workflow waits out the workflow task timeout before another worker retries it.  \u00b7  **Fix:** Graceful shutdown that drains workflow tasks (WorkerFactory.shutdown() + awaitTermination); keep the default task timeout.\n\n**What to watch:** Max end-to-end latency jumps to 10 s+ and workflow task timeouts appear after the crash; the graceful restart shows neither.\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | baseline | warm up (10 workers) | 45 s |  |\n| 2 | broken | kill -9 worker-a (half the fleet) | 75 s | Runtime.halt(): in-flight workflow tasks on worker-a are abandoned. |\n| 3 | fixed | graceful restart of worker-a | 75 s | SIGTERM path: WorkerFactory.shutdown() stops polling, awaitTermination(15 s) drains in-flight tasks, then exit. |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Phase",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
